  "criterion": "Given a registered DocgenPlugin whose on_file_extracted or on_component_resolved hook panics for one specific file/component during extract(), extract() completes, every other file's extraction and every other component's resolution proceeds unaffected (including other registered plugins still running their hooks on that same file/component), and the diagnostics include an entry whose message contains the panicking plugin's own name() value (not merely a generic 'a plugin failed' message).",
